{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122195","id":4231963220,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc78PqJU","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122195","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122195.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122195.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122195","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122195/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122195/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122195/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a3013405a661bacdf75bf95e3a20d22e7f3db711","number":122195,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `AudioEffect` icon","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes godotengine/godot-proposals#15336 (The proposal also talks about subclasses, though, so IDK if it counts as closing. But giving the base class an icon means the subclasses will inherit the icon, so they get an icon, too. Maybe future PRs for the subclasses' unique icons can refer to new proposals? Or should they all refer to this one, idk.)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nIt was discussed that this icon was good for effects:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"Audio console icon that can be used for AudioEffect\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8520f32e-6185-40c4-8dd6-c1dda53aba78\" />\r\n\r\nThis was quickly made using https://edit.svgomg.net. I noticed that everything uses `path`s, probably for easy editing and compressing later on, so I made a `path` version after prototyping with `rect`s. Afterwards I edited the source code to merge all the individual paths into one and to add the gradient (copied from `AudioBusLayout.svg`) and pasted as `AudioEffect.svg`. Finally it was optimized using SVGO. N/AI (no bot knew I had or wanted an SVG)\r\n\r\nIn the future, icons can be made for subclasses, too, but right now, I would like the UI to look good for once! :)\r\n\r\nThis is an image of the menu with it:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"191\" height=\"567\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/89524592-ef86-4580-8cb7-39eefa933392\" />\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":346,"closed_issues":2304,"created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:34:58Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":n